:: laces {"position": "774,800", "size": "100,100"}
If your jersey has laces, what do they look like?

Laces should be tight, flat, and securely attached to the jersey. They should not be loose, thin, or easily detached.

(link: "❌ Loose, thin, or detached")[(set: $flags to $flags + 1)(set: $flagnames to $flagnames + (a: "Fake-style neck laces"))(go-to: "cut")]
